WEBVTT

00:23:27.871 --> 00:23:32.704
the only coherent place that I've landed
on this so far as to say, well,

00:23:32.704 --> 00:23:35.996
if this is a curve and there's an
optimal amount of rethinking,

00:23:35.996 --> 00:23:39.538
I think most of us don't do enough
of it. Agree or disagree?

00:23:40.996 --> 00:23:44.913
You're asking me, yeah, yeah, it's a
question, do you agree or disagree?

00:23:45.996 --> 00:23:47.913
You know, my guess is I would agree.

00:23:48.413 --> 00:23:52.704
Got it. I have to take a sidebar here, JJ,
because you mentioned the office.

00:23:53.121 --> 00:23:57.288
This is work life. I read once
that you did not like

00:23:57.788 --> 00:24:01.663
the office when it premiered in the U.S.
and that you weren't even a fan of